{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roulette Hero combines the mechanics of Luck Be A Landlord and Slay the Spire, and is a brand new form of deck-building roguelite strategy game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft the Ultimate Synergy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/73c6fca7b39be2d69bc855e9dc91433c.avif?t=1761814858\" width=616 height=184 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream team of extraordinary animal companions\u2014some strike with lightning speed, some form an unmoveable wall of defense\u2026 and others? They're just irresistibly adorable! Position them wisely, combine their abilities, and unleash devastating combos to wipe out the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Spin is a New Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/de4af3d582047344ba5771ac0f4efc7d.poster.avif?t=1761814858\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/de4af3d582047344ba5771ac0f4efc7d.webm?t=1761814858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/de4af3d582047344ba5771ac0f4efc7d.mp4?t=1761814858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give the roulette a whirl and brace yourself\u2014every spin is a leap into the unknown! Will you land a devastating power-up, a game-breaking synergy, or a wild tactical twist that flips the battle on its head? One spin could turn the tide\u2026 or send you scrambling for a comeback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face Off Against Ruthless Mechanical Beasts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/3cc054753a0339e3992249bc23291ed7.poster.avif?t=1761814858\" width=600 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/3cc054753a0339e3992249bc23291ed7.webm?t=1761814858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/3cc054753a0339e3992249bc23291ed7.mp4?t=1761814858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies are made of cold, unyielding steel, but don\u2019t be intimidated! Spin the wheel, command your animal squad, and fight your way through relentless battles. Didn\u2019t land on the tile you wanted? Just keep spinning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/557b118482e32059f2c0aa36205d0d3e.poster.avif?t=1761814858\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/557b118482e32059f2c0aa36205d0d3e.webm?t=1761814858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/557b118482e32059f2c0aa36205d0d3e.mp4?t=1761814858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite roulette gameplay</strong> \u2013 Every spin brings a new surprise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of strategic combinations</strong> \u2013 13 animal types, 100+ animal tiles, and 100+ power-up Cartridges to mix and match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative mode supported</strong> \u2013 Modding and Steam Workshop integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asynchronous multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Compete for the top spot on the leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More content is in active development </strong>\u2014 Join the factory and let's tinker together!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rotation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3371510/8fe09d1fd913f25a4f4c3e8723f0440212caace5.jpg"},{"name":"Repetition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3371510/7dadfbdce1ce4a8cc07674d856daf481f97791ca.jpg"},{"name":"Loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3371510/156cf2d8d867bc99df29374bdeaae2df3e56fadd.jpg"},{"name":"Endless Loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3371510/aa68f9e2d7f93c88c6a5375700c7211c6b1aa6c9.jpg"},{"name":"Toughened Skin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3371510/4276eea613aeac3e4b8120cede2a55ab7a775094.jpg"},{"name":"Copper Skin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3371510/b35ce3ab59aba85a1e1cb7835ade861895fd8b7d.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Armor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3371510/5392a677900b1f29d907660cef9ae27a339907dc.jpg"},{"name":"Extensive Rearing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3371510/ae8ee7784b9de32bec61c70a03ec40c8290bfca6.jpg"},{"name":"Intensive Rearing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3371510/0a7fce65d4fcc4391c97c0609e640ed5b44e0fff.jpg"},{"name":"Meticulous Rearing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3